KG42.register("clusters-a7d316fe34e2daf3d47f876f",{"id":"31-coalition_formation::v142-d-CL004","paper":"31-coalition_formation","label":"State-1 energy purchase cost and line-use payment obligations","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL004","label":"State-1 energy purchase cost and line-use payment obligations","market_meaning":"When state 1 actually purchases shortage energy, the buyer cost is calculated using the given mid-market bid price and the purchased shortage quantity given under the frozen convention of R009; when the grid lines are used for P2P trading, the tax and subscription fee obligations are retained and linked to the existing β price relation. This cluster covers conditional charging and charging principles.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["settlement","participation","pricing"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"The buyer cost applies only to shortage energy purchased in state 1; the line payment obligation applies according to the actual conditions of line use. R005 shares only the qualitative purchase conditions, and the shortage input of R009 is given according to its frozen definition; a conflicting source formula is not regarded as an equivalent input, nor is β additionally added as a defined tax amount.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"The purchase conditions, input prices, buyer cost result, and payment obligations arising from line use constitute an identifiable conditional charging candidate. Its boundary does not require regenerating prices, nor does it claim to cover state-2 payments, the seller ledger, or actual tax/fee clearing.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R009","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Providing the state-1 buyer cost and the payment obligation when grid lines are used is the independent result of this cluster."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R005","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Only shares the shortage purchase and state-1 necessary purchase conditions of C001/C002; it does not use C003 to extend the state-2 payment formula."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Shares the β line-cost price interface of C002 and the exogenous p_b(t) used by C003, without re-attributing the pricing activity as primary."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL004-CN01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E008","v141-b-g01-E009","v141-b-g01-E010","v141-b-M01-E24"],"rationale":"The participation conditions for necessary shortage purchases are linked to the cost result after actual purchase within coalition 1; permission to purchase does not itself mean a transaction has occurred, nor does it introduce the untyped quantity formula of R005."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL004-CN02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C002","v141-c-R007::theta::v141-c-R007-theta-beta"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E30"],"rationale":"Under the same conditions of line use, the tax and subscription fee obligations are represented in the pricing chain as the β price relation; the two are respectively the payment principle and its price representation, and neither a separate tax amount nor duplicate charging may be created on this basis."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL004-CN03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::theta::v141-c-R007-theta-pb"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::theta::v141-c-R009-t001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E010","v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g02-E17"],"rationale":"The source-defined mid-market bid price is both an input to the initial P2P price setting and a price input to the state-1 buyer cost; this interface does not derive that bid price from the initial average price."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL004-OM01","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R009::V::pricing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E010","v141-b-g02-E17","v141-b-g02-E30"],"rationale":"The two places reference the same frozen pricing node and are unified only for display; different price objects, cost relations, and edge directions are all retained."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL004-OM02","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::settlement.payment","v141-c-R009::V::settlement.payment"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R009::V::settlement.payment","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E010","v141-b-g02-E30"],"rationale":"The two places reference the same frozen payment node; the effect of cost on pricing and the effect of price on payment have different edges and conditions, and are not merged into the same edge."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL004-OM03","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R007::theta::v141-c-R007-theta-pb","v141-c-R009::theta::v141-c-R009-t001"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E010","v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g02-E17"],"rationale":"Both refer to the source-defined mid-market bid price for the same period, one used to initialize the price and one used to calculate the state-1 cost; the input use, unit text, and original objects are retained."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL004-G01","category":"unverified_source","description":"assembled only indicates that a coherent candidate is formed within the given inputs and the stated conditions, and does not indicate that the source or scientific content has been approved. The B evidence used in this cluster remains unverified and has not undergone independent C.2 or Agent E review.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R009","v141-c-R005","v141-c-R007"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E009","v141-b-g01-E010","v141-b-g02-E17","v141-b-g02-E30"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the original text on energy purchase cost, price inputs, and line payment, and check the actual scope of application."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL004-G02","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The state-1 shortage account in g01-E009 is inconsistent with Eq. (3). Here, conditional charging is performed only using the shortage input convention already frozen in R009, and another source formula is not mapped to the same expression; the meaning of the input must still be confirmed before practical application.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R005","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002","v141-c-R009::x::v141-c-R009-x002","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E007","v141-b-g01-E009","v141-b-g01-E010"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Check the two definitions of shortage and clarify the source convention adopted for the actually purchased quantity; before upstream confirmation, different formulas or household energy-use stages must not be directly merged."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL004-G03","category":"upstream_missing","description":"β explains the price impact of taxes and subscription fees for line use, but does not separately define the tax amount, charging base, fee-item breakdown, or clearing procedure. This cluster therefore assembles only the payment obligation and the price interface, and does not form an independent executable levy bill.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R009","v141-c-R007"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C002","v141-c-R007::theta::v141-c-R007-theta-beta"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E30"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"If amount-level collection and clearing are required, the upstream should obtain the corresponding source and clarify the charging coverage of β; the tax/fee allocation must not be inferred independently from the price difference."}]},"rule_refs":["31-coalition_formation::v141-c-R009","31-coalition_formation::v141-c-R005","31-coalition_formation::v141-c-R007"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-2d6ad9d125effd47","COMP-acb8c66e9814835c","COMP-bfd4e5f3b6ab7697","COMP-c2c63e68e8427440"]});
